    "sections": {
        "description": "The ST EduCare Landing Page is a clean, minimal, and free WordPress theme designed specifically for academies, colleges, online institutions, coaching centers, and training facilities. This fast, lightweight, and fully responsive theme offers an easy-to-customize experience, making it perfect for building a professional educational website. Key features include a conversion-focused hero section, course catalog, instructor showcase, and student testimonials. With its SEO-friendly structure and fast loading speed, ST EduCare helps improve search engine rankings, making your site more discoverable on Google and other search engines. The user-friendly theme options panel ensures effortless customization, while its mobile responsiveness guarantees a seamless experience across smartphones, tablets, and desktops. It also seamlessly integrates with Elementor, providing an intuitive design experience. Comprehensive documentation and a dedicated support team are available to assist you whenever needed. Why wait? Download the ST EduCare Landing Page today and create an educational website that truly stands out! Theme Demo Page: https://striviothemes.com/demo/st-educare-pro/"
    },
